After a UI/UX pass, comment on #377 and the active UX phase epic with exact integration SHA, merged lanes included, defects repaired, blocked work, verified workflow coverage, next safe parallel lanes and required human/device evidence still outstanding.

Do not treat closed issue count, screenshots, or open PRs as integrated UI/UX evidence.

